Dialogue: 5,0:00:04.74,0:00:05.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}third.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.10,0:00:08.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}First, Black Forest Labs\Nhas
Dialogue: 5,0:00:08.28,0:00:10.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}released Flux Three\NImage.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:10.61,0:00:12.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}The company describes\Nimages up
Dialogue: 5,0:00:12.31,0:00:14.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}to four K, targeted\Nedits,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}and bounding boxes for\Nplacing
Dialogue: 5,0:00:16.32,0:00:17.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}objects.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.80,0:00:19.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Its demonstrations show\Nchanging part
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.90,0:00:21.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}of a picture while\Npreserving
Dialogue: 5,0:00:21.28,0:00:23.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}the rest. These are\Nvendor
Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.42,0:00:24.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}claims.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.11,0:00:27.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Second, the Strands team\Nhas
Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.26,0:00:29.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}released Decider Two B, a
Dialogue: 5,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}small decision model with\Ntwo
Dialogue: 5,0:00:30.97,0:00:32.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}billion parameters.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:33.09,0:00:34.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}The official announcement\Nsays it
Dialogue: 5,0:00:34.71,0:00:35.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}can run locally on a
Dialogue: 5,0:00:35.84,0:00:38.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}processor or graphics\Ncard.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:38.56,0:00:40.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}It chooses from supplied\Noptions
Dialogue: 5,0:00:40.38,0:00:42.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}or assigns scores, rather\Nthan
Dialogue: 5,0:00:42.49,0:00:44.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}writing free form text.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:44.96,0:00:47.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Code, weights, and\Ntraining materials
Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.26,0:00:48.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}are available.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:49.10,0:00:51.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Third, U S Senators Josh
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.20,0:00:52.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Hawley and Chris Murphy\Nannounced
Dialogue: 5,0:00:52.85,0:00:55.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}the AI Agent\NAccountability Act.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:55.95,0:00:57.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}The proposal would hold\Noperators
Dialogue: 5,0:00:57.72,0:00:59.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}and developers\Nresponsible for certain
Dialogue: 5,0:00:59.68,0:01:01.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}hacking damage caused by\NAI
